    {
      "node_id": "kg_doc_7",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "\"Empty Orchestra\" is the fourth episode of the third series of the British dark comedy anthology television programme \"Inside No. 9\". Written by Steve Pemberton and Reece Shearsmith and directed by Guillem Morales, the episode first aired on 7 March 2017, on BBC 2. The episode is set in a karaoke booth, and follows a group of work colleagues—Greg (Shearsmith), Fran (Sarah Hadland), Connie (Tamzin Outhwaite), Janet (Emily Howlett) and Duane (Javone Prince)—celebrating the promotion of Roger (Pemberton). Rebekah Hinds also stars.",
      "depth": 0,
      "parent_id": null,
      "value": 0.9999999966865158,
      "temperature": 0.9999999966865158,
      "expanded": false,
      "visit_count": 0,
